<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks fell, one rose and 10 were flat in a nine-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,597.6 points, 1.3 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.3 percent in a 9.4-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
